        "why": "It answered what was asked."
      },
      {
        "text": "getent asks for IPv6 first",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. And www has an AAAA record."
      },
      {
        "text": "The A record was deleted",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "dig showed it."
      },
      {
        "text": "IPv6 was switched on for that one query",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "The machine has none to switch on."
      }
    ]
  },
