        "correct": false,
        "why": "That is not the rule."
      },
      {
        "text": "A CNAME cannot share its name",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. The bare domain has NS, SOA and MX."
      },
      {
        "text": "www does not exist in this zone yet",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It does."
      },
      {
        "text": "A records are cheaper",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "DNS has no price per record."
      }
    ]
  },
